{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "071452cd-e5f9-8b6b-842d-8315d3fbf799",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:38:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, yeah, hello. Jose Morales. I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed up for the night, so I figured I'd get a machine, but, uh, here you are. Look at that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Storm line stays open into the evening. What can I do for you, Mr. Morales?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:36:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm calling about the water on my street again. Kay Street, I'm at 468, up on the Hill. After that nor'easter Friday into Saturday, three days ago now, the whole low spot out front turned into a pond. [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me there. Can you say that again? The street flooded?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street, yeah. Flooded. Same thing it did last month. I'm a landlord, so I'm used to people calling me about water, and now I'm the one calling. Funny how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:37:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Did it get into the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, the house stayed dry, thank God. Basement's fine. But it's the second time in two months the street goes under, and nothing gets done. The drain just sits there, I guess. [inaudible]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost the end of that. You think the drain's blocked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think so, yeah. Can't swear to it, I'm no drain expert, I just own a ladder. But what's got me bothered is the kids. There's a robotics team that meets at a place down the block, and it runs late Thursdays, so they're walking home in the dark. Plus people with dogs going right along the edge of the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:37:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a good thing to flag. Dark and standing water isn't great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:37:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So who do I call to get it checked? Is that you, or is that somebody else? Because I'd like somebody to actually look at it this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's us. I'll put in a request for a crew to inspect the storm drain at 468 Kay Street. Is the water still standing, or has it drained down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:38:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's mostly down now but there's a lot of leaves and gunk packed over the grate. [line breaks up] Still wicked muddy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've got that, debris on the grate. Best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0160. Someone will follow up once it's scheduled. Crews are still catching up from the storm, so it may take a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Just, you know, before Thursday would be nice. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:38:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that. You take care, Mr. Morales."
    }
  ],
